    {
      "id": "claim_415feff1061141a4b16b48b8ecff7fdb",
      "statement": "`redact_url` masks embedded URL credentials (`scheme://user:password@` -> `scheme://user:***@`), while `redact_text(text, secrets)` additionally masks `authorization`/`private-token` header values and replaces every literal occurrence of each supplied secret with `***`.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://app/core/util.py#L8-L26",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:11265ab274f35309ea6e32dd4b5ae6db0843514610716cd19e5351b01f0be4fe:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_1609832c1a4e4da285cc931a8e8cf957",
      "statement": "The pipeline threads `secrets = (token,)` through every output boundary: `pipeline.make_logger` redacts each appended log line, `run_openwiki` redacts every CLI stdout/stderr line before writing it to the log file, and `run_git_status` redacts both git streams before returning them, which is why `IngestionError` and the durable job `error` share the redacted text.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://app/services/ingestion.py#L112-L164",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:f416587e57c439bbadd548f153edebe649c3582cdc63c2d6db28990168a9feb2:"
        },
        {
