    {
      "id": "claim_f2e2eae64fde49988f2566e1174aad4e",
      "statement": "Provider API keys are deliberately absent from `Settings` and from `build_env`: they stay in the process environment (layered with `<OPENWIKI_CONFIG_DIR>/.env`) and are forwarded to the OpenWiki subprocess untouched, whereas only service-owned variables such as `OPENWIKI_CONFIG_DIR`, `OPENWIKI_TELEMETRY_DISABLED` and page concurrency are overridden.",
