    {
      "id": "claim_1c374722a84f42d4a1667ef72e73fbd6",
      "statement": "`ALLOW_LOCAL_GIT` (default `false`) gates local-path and `file://` cloning inside `validate_git_url`, the single enforcement point; the rejection message names the flag, and the README classifies enabling it in production as unsupported because a container with it on can read any git repository reachable through its filesystem.",
